opod: --role gateway needs --leader <url> (or OPOD_LEADER_URL): the leader it mirrors and pushes its usage to
  usage: opod up [--config <path>] [--auto-pull=false] [--no-wizard] [--exclusive] [--role gateway --leader <url>] [--role door --routes <file>]
  opod up --help for every flag
